        <tr><td data-th="Item">Background</td><td data-th="Detail">Early completion of the NVIDIA-run AI core engineer course. Fifth of 53 teams in the preliminary round of the National Institute of Korean Language AI model competition, as a team. Undergraduate at Sangmyung University, majoring in economics and finance with a second major in human-AI engineering.</td></tr>
