      <p>Where this project is stuck is the same place lab technology gets stuck on its way to a product: the numbers come out, but the release criterion does not. 3D reconstruction, real-time edge processing and human movement analysis interlock in one device, so we are looking for a validation partner who can see all three, and for university research infrastructure.</p>
